      "message": "It\u0027s a bit confusing, because ICU uses a couple of other @IntraCoreApi APIs, not in this list:\n\n`VersionCodes.R` which is inlined by javac\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/icu/android_icu4j/libcore_bridge/src/java/com/android/i18n/system/ZygoteHooks.java;l\u003d106?q\u003dVersionCode\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain:external%2Ficu%2F\n\n`NativeAllocationRegistry.createMalloced` which is also `@SystemApi(MODULE_LIBRARIES)`\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/icu/android_icu4j/libcore_bridge/src/java/com/android/icu/util/regex/PatternNative.java;l\u003d30?q\u003dNativeAllocation\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain:external%2Ficu%2F",
