      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Are you confident it\u0027s only those three, or do we need to investigate the ICU-libcore API dependencies further?\n\nNot just these three. It\u0027s basically a subset of the APIs in this list.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:libcore/mmodules/intracoreapi/api/intra/current.txt;l\u003d1\n\nFor example, I believe that `Compatibility` is also used in ICU. If we decide to hard-code a list of @IntraCoreApi APIs here, I can try to go through the list and find you a more precise list.\n\nAre you going to treat ICU as a platform component on Android S+ ? There are very few changes of @IntraCoreApi usage in ICU since Android S, but I am not sure if there is any usage removed, and we may not see the usage on the `main` branch.",
      "parentUuid": "cb53012b_35e30793",
